  "interpretation": "In a concrete but narrow synthetic rank-4 LoRA SGD task the 4-worker parameter-server algorithm returns numerically equivalent outputs, but the four local processes were slower in end-to-end wall on both OS and both sizes. Do not generalize to GPU distributed-training implementations, cross-host networking, mature ring-allreduce, or larger batches. Per-worker CPU/RSS were not measured and thus no total-resource positive claim is admissible. This is a valid local-process training speed negative, not a mathematical impossibility result.",
